SUMMARY:FSKKR — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: FS KKR CAPITAL CORP (FSKKR)\nRoadshow: https://www.netroadshow.com
 /events/login/1PeTHmohYCllHwHBIExtNXzSneXMw5RroybFS\n\nDeal context:\nFS K
 KR Capital Corp (FSK)\, a BDC externally managed and regulated under the 1
 940 Act\, is launching a 5-year SEC Registered senior unsecured note offer
 ing with initial price talk of 7.5-7.75%\, targeting today's business for 
 pricing. The deal carries split ratings of Ba1/BB+/BBB- (Moody's/S&P/Fitch
 )\, placing it at the crossover/high-yield boundary\, with BofA acting as 
 B&D alongside BMO\, JPM\, KEYBCM\, RBCCM\, and SMBC as active bookrunners.
  Proceeds are intended for general corporate purposes including potential 
 repayment of outstanding indebtedness under credit facilities and certain 
 notes\, with settlement expected T+5 on June 8\, 2026.
